  "problems": [
    "For this US visitor the store's add-to-cart opens an in-page WorldShopping (worldshopping.jp) international proxy-purchase modal; the native cart stayed empty after adds on 3 items (jawdrop 1276265, tower 1285942, CURVER SOFTEX 1285034). Coded geo-blocked; reviewer may prefer add-to-cart-refused.",
    "evidence-1 (sha 3c3a53a1...) was first exported believing it was minicart-1; the modal turned out to be WorldShopping, so it is recorded as evidence only, not a page-state.",
    "Chunk 4 of evidence-1 was small enough to return inline (L2 disclosed limit); not quoted or used.",
    "Hidden pane rendered blank screenshots below the fold; colour-swatch selection could not be visually confirmed.",
    "Cart path /shop/app/cart/cart/ is disallowed in robots.txt (recorded only).",
    "Some navigations were by URL to same-site hrefs read from the page because clicks on off-viewport elements did not register; listing URL had query categoryList=1113 (stripped).",
    "Header shows a member-registration link and no account name: treated as logged out. No items added; no removals needed."
